---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { WHATSAPP_NOTIFICATIONS_ENABLED } from "../lib/featureFlags";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How it works"
  description="How TenderBell aggregates PRAZ e-GP tenders and matches them to your business."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h1>From PRAZ's portal to your inbox</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        TenderBell is deliberately simple: one trustworthy source, a clear matching profile,
        and a notification schedule that fits your plan.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--subtle">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="step-number">1</span>
          <h3>We fetch PRAZ e-GP</h3>
          <p>
            TenderBell's MVP tracks a single, official source: Zimbabwe's PRAZ e-Government
            Procurement portal (egp.praz.org.zw). We fetch it on a shared schedule, with polite
            rate limits, and normalize each listing's public summary fields and its official link.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="step-number">2</span>
          <h3>You tell us what matters</h3>
          <p>
            Set up an interest profile: sector, value range, issuing authority, region, and
            keywords. TenderBell matches new tenders against it — you only hear about what's
            actually relevant to your business.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="step-number">3</span>
          <h3>You get notified</h3>
          <p>
            Free subscribers get a daily digest of everything that matched. Pro subscribers are
            notified after each aggregation run, as soon as a match is found. Every notification
            links back to the official PRAZ listing — we never host or resell the underlying bid
            documents.
            {WHATSAPP_NOTIFICATIONS_ENABLED && (
              <>
                {" "}Pro subscribers can also opt in to receive those notifications via
                WhatsApp.
              </>
            )}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Ready to stop checking manually?</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/signup">Set up your alerts</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
